reagent-name-cryonex = cryonex
reagent-desc-cryonex = A viscous, plasma-stabilized precursor base. Inert on its own - it only becomes useful as a feedstock for further cryogenic synthesis.

reagent-name-cryzine = cryzine
reagent-desc-cryzine = A cold stable stasis compound. Only heals inside a properly chilled cryo pod - anywhere else, at any temperature, it's actively toxic.

reagent-name-traumazine = traumazine
reagent-desc-traumazine = An extremely potent trama treatment - but only while the patient is inside a cryo pod & cold enough. Used anywhere else it will savage them instead, no matter how cold they are.

reagent-name-toxazine = toxazine
reagent-desc-toxazine = An extremely potent antitoxin & cellular repair agent - but only while the patient is inside a cryo pod & cold enough. Used anywhere else it poisons & mutates them instead, no matter how cold they are.

reagent-name-somaline = somaline
reagent-desc-somaline = A potent regenerative catalyst. Rapidly regrows missing limbs. Its genetic repair effect only works inside a cryo pod - anywhere else it inflicts genetic damage instead, regardless of temperature.
